&Scoped-define SELF-NAME tg-dt-entrega-ped
&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL tg-dt-entrega-ped w-cadsim
ON VALUE-CHANGED OF tg-dt-entrega-ped IN FRAME f-cad /* Alterar a data de Previs∆o Faturamento do pedido */
DO:
